  description: '"Kewl Tune Mix" + 1+ Tuners

    Gains 1500 ATK while your opponent
    has a Tuner in their field or GY. During your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect):
    You can Tribute this card; choose 2 non-Synchro Tuners in your GY, add 1 of them
    to your hand, and if you do, Special Summon the other, then immediately after
    this effect resolves, you can Synchro Summon 1 Tuner Synchro Monster. You can
    only use this effect of "Kewl Tune Remix" once per turn.'
